  "title": "Swiss-Style Veal and Mushrooms",
  "description": "Do you wish dinner could be ready when you got home? It takes just 10 minutes to \"fix it\" in the morning, then the slow cooker lets you \"forget it\" while it cooks all day.",
  "authors": [
    "Campbell's Kitchen"
  ],
  "date_published": "2010-02-08T15:39:23-05:00",
